brief:
R2 execution for 등대지기 곰. Authority: approved final plan .gjc/_session-01a1d34e-d507-728a-b772-611f1a5fb26d/plans/ralplan/01a1d34e-d507-728a-b772-611f1a5fb26d/pending-approval.md (stage-03-final, sha256 11e30dc470d9ed82caa39517a0aad15f682062ee44bfe8b7b7888b77916e9c30). GAME_DESIGN.md is the sole spec; AGENTS.md rules apply (no package.json, pure logic.js, 8 palette colors only, UI text in src/strings.js, never change spec numbers in code, tests' expected values come from the spec, same attempt at most 6 times).
HUMAN GATES (hard): goal 2 (goal-2) may start only after the human approves the design-v2 diff; goal 3 (goal-3) may start only after the human has verified goal-2 in a browser against 9장 8~23번. Do not self-approve. A goal's completion = the human confirms the cited 9장 items in a browser; tests passing is not completion; fixture screenshots are not evidence. Commits: one per goal, messages design-v2: / goal-2: / goal-3:. Out of scope: levels 2·3, sound, score persistence, high score, leaderboard, anything in 10장.

@goal: design-v2 — GAME_DESIGN.md only
Edit ONLY GAME_DESIGN.md (v1 -> v2); zero changes under src/ or test/. Follow final plan sections 3 (3.1 2장 rule rows, 3.1b 점수 표, 3.2 R2 임시 구현 표기, 3.3 3장 화면 흐름, 3.4 4장 sprites, 3.5 6장 사용처 열, 3.6 9장), 4 (9장 8~35 draft), 5 (decisions D1~D32) and executor notes E1~E4: (E1) delete the vacuous clause at the end of 9장 25번 ("그 스페이스바로 등불이 켜지거나 곰이 움직이지 않는다"); (E2) HUD 남은 시간 올림 표기 is 사용자 확정 (relabel the source; drop any "대안: HUD 내림" wording; keep 29번 ±1초 근사 문구); (E3) compute the first 3 mulberry32 values for seed 20261113 with an independent one-line node command and write them in the 난수 행; (E4) don't list HUD 올림 vs 내림 as an open human-approval item. 9장 1~7번 must stay byte-identical (number, sentence, `[x] 사람 브라우저 확인 2026-11-13`); 8번부터 이어 붙여 총 35개 (goal-2 = 8~23, goal-3 = 24~35); 6장 hex 8개 unchanged (verify by extracting the 8 hex strings from `git show HEAD:GAME_DESIGN.md` and the working file in order and comparing; `-` lines may only differ in 사용처/이름 text, 인덱스 7 이름 = "밝은 빛"); no `localStorage` wording; 점수 저장 row says "R3. R2에서는 만들지 않는다". Every new 9장 item is a sentence a human can judge in a browser and cites its 장 numbers. Then run a critic (read-only) review of the diff, fix findings, commit `design-v2:` and STOP: report to the human that they must read the GAME_DESIGN.md diff (list the 에이전트 제안 items from the plan 9절) and approve before goal-2.
Acceptance: `git diff --stat` shows GAME_DESIGN.md only; 9장 1~7 lines not in `-` diff; hex tokens identical before/after; critic OKAY; commit made; human approval requested.

@goal: goal-2 — 목표물·위협·타이머 (9장 8~23번)
Starts only after the human approves design-v2. Implement per the approved GAME_DESIGN.md v2 and final plan section 6 (goal-2): src/logic.js (pure: createState with required nowMs, lastMoveMs in level state, pressMove/pressLight/advance, mulberry32, 점수 점등분 +100, 기절, 갈매기 300 ms, 60 s timer, remainingSeconds ceil), src/main.js (rAF loop, preventDefault before event.repeat return, HUD), src/sprites.js (gull, lamp off/on, bear stunned; indices 0~7 only), src/strings.js (new), test/logic.test.js. At most 5 files. Expected values in tests come from the spec numbers, not from code. After implementation STOP and tell the human: open index.html (python3 -m http.server 8000) and check 9장 8~23번 (1~7 still hold).

@goal: goal-3 — 승패와 화면 전환 (9장 24~35번)
Starts only after the human browser-verified goal-2. Implement per approved GAME_DESIGN.md v2 and final plan section 6 (goal-3): title screen, play -> ending (level 1 clear, 스펙 원문 엔딩 문구 split into two strings in src/strings.js) / failure, 스페이스바 back to title, 클리어 보너스 floor(remaining s)*10 added once at the single play->ending transition, score reset to 0 on new run, keydown consumption rule. Files: logic.js, main.js, strings.js, levels.js, test/logic.test.js (max 5; stop and report if a 6th is needed). After implementation STOP and tell the human to check 9장 24~35번; the four submission screenshots (title/play/clear/fail) are taken by the human from real play.
